{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And the word of YHWH came</b>: This prophecy too is joined, but there was another prophecy. He will explain the matters that HaShem called by the hand of the former prophets, and these are: \"Thus says…\" widow and stranger and orphan."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {0 "The comment opens with ויהי which I render as the lemma from Zechariah 7:8 (ויהי דבר־יהוה); the Hebrew itself is terse and slightly elliptical (דבקה without an explicit object), preserved here literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:14.714102856Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}